{"id":"n15199-1-8","stage":2,"title":"엎드리다 · 卧","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15199-1-8-1","ko":"주사 맞게 엎드리세요.","zh":"请趴下，准备打针。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"주사","meaning":"注射","explanation":"주사：注射。","readings":[{"term":"주사","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91770","senseId":"1","lemma":"주사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주사","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3"}},{"text":"맞게","meaning":"打针","explanation":"맞다：打针；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66233","senseId":"2","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞게","audio":"/audio/c3bb076cd0a1f673ec8c.mp3"}},{"text":"엎드리세요.","meaning":"卧，趴","explanation":"엎드리다：卧，趴；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"엎드리다","audio":"/audio/96276df0293f6631a799.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15199","senseId":"1","lemma":"엎드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엎드리세요","audio":"/audio/cb963df10c1684900cd5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"32b004ef02722e1b","term":"주사","zh":"注射","audio":"/audio/32b004ef02722e1be5d8.mp3","entryId":"91770","definition":"用注射器直接往人或动物体内注射药液。","pronunciation":["주ː사"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"打针","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66233","definition":"接受在身上扎针、注射等的治疗。","pronunciation":["맏따"]},{"id":"96276df0293f6631","term":"엎드리다","zh":"卧，趴","audio":"/audio/96276df0293f6631a799.mp3","entryId":"15199","definition":"肚子朝下，全身贴在地面。","pronunciation":["업뜨리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ff665ede0387f435fa7b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15199-1-8-2","ko":"아프지 않게 놓아 주세요.","zh":"请轻一点打，别让我疼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아프지","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프지","audio":"/audio/3aba0a4a693d591131f7.mp3"}},{"text":"않게","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않게","audio":"/audio/070ef42fea7052c4ede6.mp3"}},{"text":"놓아","meaning":"注射，扎","explanation":"놓다：注射，扎；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"놓다","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89534","senseId":"19","lemma":"놓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놓아","audio":"/audio/e0eb2958927d3ff795cf.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"bac7d20277d64d67","term":"놓다","zh":"注射，扎","audio":"/audio/bac7d20277d64d673e40.mp3","entryId":"89534","definition":"以治疗为目的给患者刺针头。","pronunciation":["노타"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e249001e14285907e8b4.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.414,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr